            <h4 style="color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #004080; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size:20px; font-weight:600;">About Er. Pramesh Kumar </h4>
            <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; line-height:30px;color:black;">

                Er. Pramesh Kumar is currently serving as an Assistant Professor in the Electrical Engineering Department at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh, affiliated to Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University Uttar Pradesh, Lucknow, India. Along with his academic duties, he is also entrusted with important responsibilities as the In-charge of department, Deputy Controller of Examination.
                He has completed his B.Tech. in Electrical Engineering from Institute of Engineering & Technology, MJP Rohilkhand University Bareilly, and his M.Tech. in Electrical Power Engineering from Maulana Azad National Institute of Technology Bhopal Madhya Pradesh and Pursuing Ph.D. Degree from Maulana Azad National Institute of Technology Bhopal Madhya Pradesh India. Er. Pramesh Kumar has published 7 research papers in science citation index and peer reviewed journals and presented research papers in International Conferences. His academic and research interests include Power System, Renewable energy Sources, Optimization Techniques and Electricity bidding concepts, ANN and Fuzzy system.
            </p>


